OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry carries first passengers
OL,4,Aacross Mersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new ferry has officially set sail and
OL,7,Fcarried its first passengers across the
OL,8,FMersey.
OL,10,FThe #26m Royal Daffodil, the first
OL,11,FMersey ferry to be built in 60 years,
OL,12,Farrived in September.
OL,14,FThere have been no crossings between
OL,15,FLiverpool and the Wirral for the last
OL,16,Ffew weeks because of technical problems
OL,17,Fwith the other ferry, the Snowdrop.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
