OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry carries first passengers
OL,4,Aacross Mersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region Mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram said: "We've got a
OL,8,Fresponsibility to protect these iconic
OL,9,Fferries for future generations, and the
OL,10,FRoyal Daffodil is the next step in
OL,11,Fmaking sure that happens."
